<title>UK: Bancaja launches 20 bln peseta asset-backed bonds.</title>
<headline>Bancaja launches 20 bln peseta asset-backed bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche</p>
<p>mortgage-backed domestic issue was announced by lead manager J.P</p>
<p>Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORFONDO DE TITULIZACION HIPOTECARIA BANCAJA 1</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    19.25 BLN PTA BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY     MARCH.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +16 BP    AVG LIFE    4.6 YEARS</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	ISS PRICE  PAR	 MOODYS	AAA</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B IS A 750 MLN PESATA ISSUE, AND SOLE UNDERWRITER IS</p>
<p>BANCAJA. THE BOND PAYS 3M LIBOR +45 BP AND IS RATED A2 BY</p>
<p>MOODY'S.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING    AIAF	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SPAIN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   TAX PROVS  NO GROSS UP</p>
<p> NOTES	SECURED BY RESIDENTIAL MORTGAGES ORIGINATED BY</p>
<p>		BANCAJA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
